[
  {
    "sentence_order": 1,
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 7.0,
    "text": "Transcriber: Translate TED",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 2,
    "start_time": 0.141,
    "end_time": 1.452,
    "text": "I was not one of those kids",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 3,
    "start_time": 1.476,
    "end_time": 4.649,
    "text": "that knew exactly what they wanted to do when they were growing up.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 4,
    "start_time": 4.673,
    "end_time": 6.307,
    "text": "In the last 15 years of my career,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 5,
    "start_time": 6.331,
    "end_time": 9.105,
    "text": "I've been an English teacher, attorney, video game creator",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 6,
    "start_time": 9.129,
    "end_time": 10.717,
    "text": "and now, a toilet paper salesman,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 7,
    "start_time": 10.741,
    "end_time": 13.06,
    "text": "selling millions of rolls of toilet paper a year.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 8,
    "start_time": 13.084,
    "end_time": 15.501,
    "text": "[The Way We Work]",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 9,
    "start_time": 16.428,
    "end_time": 19.739,
    "text": "Life is about finding the intersection of what you really, really love",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 10,
    "start_time": 19.763,
    "end_time": 21.68,
    "text": "with what you're really, really good at.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 11,
    "start_time": 21.704,
    "end_time": 24.546,
    "text": "As simple as it sounds, it's really not that easy to find.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 12,
    "start_time": 24.57,
    "end_time": 26.575,
    "text": "After a brief stint as an English teacher,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 13,
    "start_time": 26.599,
    "end_time": 29.134,
    "text": "I went to law school and ended up becoming an attorney",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 14,
    "start_time": 29.158,
    "end_time": 31.073,
    "text": "at a big law firm here in New York City.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 15,
    "start_time": 31.097,
    "end_time": 33.498,
    "text": "Like most Americans, for the next two, three years,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 16,
    "start_time": 33.522,
    "end_time": 35.486,
    "text": "I was holding on to my job for dear life,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 17,
    "start_time": 35.51,
    "end_time": 38.818,
    "text": "working really late hours at a job that I thought maybe I was good at",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 18,
    "start_time": 38.842,
    "end_time": 40.851,
    "text": "but certainly not one that I really loved.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 19,
    "start_time": 40.875,
    "end_time": 42.278,
    "text": "I then came upon the epiphany",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 20,
    "start_time": 42.302,
    "end_time": 45.128,
    "text": "that it takes years if not tens of thousands of hours",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 21,
    "start_time": 45.152,
    "end_time": 46.683,
    "text": "to get really good at something.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 22,
    "start_time": 46.707,
    "end_time": 48.762,
    "text": "I really didn't have a lot of time to waste.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 23,
    "start_time": 48.786,
    "end_time": 51.208,
    "text": "This talk isn't for those looking to quit their job",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 24,
    "start_time": 51.232,
    "end_time": 54.334,
    "text": "because they don't like their boss or they had a long day at work.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 25,
    "start_time": 54.358,
    "end_time": 57.457,
    "text": "This is for those that are ready to make the completely scary leap",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 26,
    "start_time": 57.481,
    "end_time": 58.639,
    "text": "into a brand-new career.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 27,
    "start_time": 58.663,
    "end_time": 60.762,
    "text": "So as you think about making a career change,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 28,
    "start_time": 60.786,
    "end_time": 62.601,
    "text": "here are a few tips I hope you consider",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 29,
    "start_time": 62.625,
    "end_time": 64.778,
    "text": "and a few things I've picked up along the way.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 30,
    "start_time": 64.802,
    "end_time": 68.283,
    "text": "First, there's three things to think about before you're ready to move on.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 31,
    "start_time": 68.307,
    "end_time": 70.598,
    "text": "Number one: professional life is about learning.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 32,
    "start_time": 70.622,
    "end_time": 72.956,
    "text": "If you're not even interested in learning anymore,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 33,
    "start_time": 72.98,
    "end_time": 74.131,
    "text": "that's a huge red flag",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 34,
    "start_time": 74.155,
    "end_time": 76.884,
    "text": "that there might not be a future for you in that industry.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 35,
    "start_time": 76.908,
    "end_time": 79.159,
    "text": "Number two: career changes are often gut-driven.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 36,
    "start_time": 79.183,
    "end_time": 81.052,
    "text": "If you constantly have sleepless nights",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 37,
    "start_time": 81.076,
    "end_time": 83.702,
    "text": "where you're wide awake staring at the ceiling thinking,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 38,
    "start_time": 83.726,
    "end_time": 86.976,
    "text": "\"Oh, man. I can't live with myself if I never try to make this change",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 39,
    "start_time": 87.0,
    "end_time": 89.06,
    "text": "or if I don't even actually investigate it,\"",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 40,
    "start_time": 89.084,
    "end_time": 90.235,
    "text": "then trust your gut.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 41,
    "start_time": 90.259,
    "end_time": 92.171,
    "text": "It might be time for that career change.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 42,
    "start_time": 92.195,
    "end_time": 93.346,
    "text": "On the flip side,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 43,
    "start_time": 93.37,
    "end_time": 95.476,
    "text": "one reason to not move on is short-term pain.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 44,
    "start_time": 95.5,
    "end_time": 96.788,
    "text": "If you don't like your boss",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 45,
    "start_time": 96.812,
    "end_time": 98.816,
    "text": "or people at the office are grating on you,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 46,
    "start_time": 98.84,
    "end_time": 101.986,
    "text": "that's actually not a good reason to absolutely change your career,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 47,
    "start_time": 102.01,
    "end_time": 103.728,
    "text": "because when you do change a career,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 48,
    "start_time": 103.752,
    "end_time": 105.805,
    "text": "you generally have to start from the bottom,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 49,
    "start_time": 105.829,
    "end_time": 108.179,
    "text": "and you'll probably feel a lot of short-term pain,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 50,
    "start_time": 108.203,
    "end_time": 110.873,
    "text": "whether it's through a lack of salary or lack of a title.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 51,
    "start_time": 110.897,
    "end_time": 112.555,
    "text": "Pain at any job is inevitable.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 52,
    "start_time": 112.579,
    "end_time": 115.494,
    "text": "So now you're convinced that it's time to change your career.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 53,
    "start_time": 115.518,
    "end_time": 117.654,
    "text": "Then there's three things to do immediately.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 54,
    "start_time": 117.678,
    "end_time": 120.348,
    "text": "First: network, network, network.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 55,
    "start_time": 120.372,
    "end_time": 123.105,
    "text": "No one ever builds a career without a good mentor",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 56,
    "start_time": 123.129,
    "end_time": 124.382,
    "text": "or a good support network.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 57,
    "start_time": 124.406,
    "end_time": 127.228,
    "text": "What I mean by networking is getting all the great advice",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 58,
    "start_time": 127.252,
    "end_time": 128.608,
    "text": "that you can possibly get.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 59,
    "start_time": 128.632,
    "end_time": 131.437,
    "text": "Technology has made it so simple to reach out to new people",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 60,
    "start_time": 131.461,
    "end_time": 134.107,
    "text": "to say, \"Hey, I'm thinking about making a career change.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 61,
    "start_time": 134.131,
    "end_time": 136.33,
    "text": "Do you have just five minutes to chat with me?\"",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 62,
    "start_time": 136.354,
    "end_time": 139.348,
    "text": "That passion and that hunger and that ability to be a sponge",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 63,
    "start_time": 139.372,
    "end_time": 140.868,
    "text": "really attracts awesome mentors",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 64,
    "start_time": 140.892,
    "end_time": 142.851,
    "text": "and people willing to give you their time",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 65,
    "start_time": 142.875,
    "end_time": 144.272,
    "text": "to give you some good advice.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 66,
    "start_time": 144.296,
    "end_time": 146.018,
    "text": "So go out there and meet new people.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 67,
    "start_time": 146.042,
    "end_time": 148.059,
    "text": "The second thing you need to do immediately",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 68,
    "start_time": 148.083,
    "end_time": 149.568,
    "text": "is shore up your finances.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 69,
    "start_time": 149.592,
    "end_time": 151.647,
    "text": "The reality is, when you change your career,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 70,
    "start_time": 151.671,
    "end_time": 153.976,
    "text": "you'll either start with a job with a lower title",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 71,
    "start_time": 154.0,
    "end_time": 156.208,
    "text": "or lower pay or maybe even no pay,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 72,
    "start_time": 156.232,
    "end_time": 158.485,
    "text": "especially if you're starting your own business.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 73,
    "start_time": 158.509,
    "end_time": 161.376,
    "text": "So going out there and making sure your finances are in order",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 74,
    "start_time": 161.4,
    "end_time": 163.075,
    "text": "to make the transition less painful",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 75,
    "start_time": 163.099,
    "end_time": 164.44,
    "text": "is really, really important.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 76,
    "start_time": 164.464,
    "end_time": 167.578,
    "text": "For me personally, as I made the transition from being an attorney",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 77,
    "start_time": 167.602,
    "end_time": 169.148,
    "text": "over to a video game creator,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 78,
    "start_time": 169.172,
    "end_time": 172.69,
    "text": "I wanted to have at least six to 12 months of personal runway in the bank.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 79,
    "start_time": 172.714,
    "end_time": 175.511,
    "text": "Six to 12 months might not be the right number for you,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 80,
    "start_time": 175.535,
    "end_time": 178.263,
    "text": "but be honest with yourself on what that number should be.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 81,
    "start_time": 178.287,
    "end_time": 182.707,
    "text": "Number three, if you're not ready to make the full jump right at this moment,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 82,
    "start_time": 182.731,
    "end_time": 184.115,
    "text": "then get your side hustle on.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 83,
    "start_time": 184.139,
    "end_time": 187.488,
    "text": "Side hustles could be anything from volunteering with an organization",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 84,
    "start_time": 187.512,
    "end_time": 189.709,
    "text": "that's in the new industry you want to go into,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 85,
    "start_time": 189.733,
    "end_time": 192.462,
    "text": "could be starting your business part-time on the weekends.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 86,
    "start_time": 192.486,
    "end_time": 195.698,
    "text": "It's a free way to get a taste to see if you really love something.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 87,
    "start_time": 195.722,
    "end_time": 197.254,
    "text": "So you're ready to make the move",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 88,
    "start_time": 197.278,
    "end_time": 198.951,
    "text": "or maybe you already made the move.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 89,
    "start_time": 198.975,
    "end_time": 201.883,
    "text": "Here are three things you should think about doing, right now.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 90,
    "start_time": 201.907,
    "end_time": 205.238,
    "text": "One: do not -- I repeat -- do not burn bridges.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 91,
    "start_time": 205.262,
    "end_time": 207.12,
    "text": "You spent years building those bridges,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 92,
    "start_time": 207.144,
    "end_time": 208.294,
    "text": "why burn them now?",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 93,
    "start_time": 208.318,
    "end_time": 209.958,
    "text": "The world is such a small place,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 94,
    "start_time": 209.982,
    "end_time": 211.982,
    "text": "especially with all these online platforms,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 95,
    "start_time": 212.006,
    "end_time": 214.538,
    "text": "that, believe me, you will see these people again",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 96,
    "start_time": 214.562,
    "end_time": 216.918,
    "text": "and probably in the most inopportune times.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 97,
    "start_time": 216.942,
    "end_time": 219.258,
    "text": "Number two: take stock of what you've learned",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 98,
    "start_time": 219.282,
    "end_time": 221.098,
    "text": "in your previous career or careers.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 99,
    "start_time": 221.122,
    "end_time": 223.742,
    "text": "Most likely, a lot of those things are really applicable",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 100,
    "start_time": 223.766,
    "end_time": 225.481,
    "text": "to your new job and your new career,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 101,
    "start_time": 225.505,
    "end_time": 228.658,
    "text": "whether it's interacting with people, playing on a team",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 102,
    "start_time": 228.682,
    "end_time": 230.858,
    "text": "or dealing with jerks and assholes.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 103,
    "start_time": 230.882,
    "end_time": 233.27,
    "text": "All those things are really universally applicable.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 104,
    "start_time": 233.294,
    "end_time": 235.73,
    "text": "You'll find jerks no matter what industry you're in;",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 105,
    "start_time": 235.754,
    "end_time": 238.337,
    "text": "no one's immune to it, everyone's got to figure it out,",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 106,
    "start_time": 238.361,
    "end_time": 240.367,
    "text": "and you probably know how to do it already.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 107,
    "start_time": 240.391,
    "end_time": 243.41,
    "text": "Lastly, when you start your new job, you're going to be nervous.",
    "translation": null,
    "ipa": null
  },
  {
    "sentence_order": 108,
